@startuml
 title Local alpha LA1 - implemented durable import sequence
 actor User
 participant "Web/API" as Web
 participant "Application" as App
 database "Private intent/jobs" as State
 participant "Existing worker" as Worker
 participant "Archive effects" as Archive
 participant "Provider adapters" as Providers
 User -> Web : select packages, collection, enrichment policy
 Web -> App : plan and accept validated intent
 App -> State : atomic intent + acceptance receipt
 App --> Web : stable ImportIds, atomic package admission
 note over Web,Worker : Browser may close; pending upload still requires bytes
 Worker -> App : periodically resume all unsettled Import pages
 App -> State : readiness and current authorization
 alt browser bytes incomplete
 App -> State : retain resumable upload state
 else complete package and valid destination
 App -> Archive : ensure target and preserve using existing journals
 Archive --> App : committed Capture/Representation identities
 App -> State : reconcile committed preservation
 par optional metadata
 App -> Providers : acquire identity / artwork with existing jobs
 Providers --> App : retained snapshots or typed failure
 App -> Archive : resolver / Asset effects, protect manual authority
 else requested preparation (LA2)
 App -> State : admit existing per-track jobs
 end
 App -> State : independent step outcomes and retry actions
 end
 User -> Web : reopen import list
 Web -> App : authorized status query
 App --> Web : preserved, processing, needs-input or partial outcome
 note over App,Archive
 Crash between effect and bookkeeping: reconcile stable identities.
 Cancellation after commit retains originals and stops remaining owned work.
 end note
@enduml
